<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Engineering Branch Stats</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Avenir&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Avenir', sans-serif;
      background: #f9f9f9;
      color: #333;
    }
    .hero {
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549924231-f129b911e442?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }
    .hero-content {
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .section {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: white;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: 2em;
      color: #2c3e50;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .section p {
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      font-size: 1.1em;
    }
    .highlight {
      color: #007bff;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Engineering Branch Placement & Postgraduate Stats</h1>
      <p>Your snapshot guide to careers and future studies</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS)</h2>
    <p><span class="highlight">Highest Package:</span> ₹51.03 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Average Package:</span> ₹10.49 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Median Package:</span> ₹8.48 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Placement Rate:</span> 73%</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Hiring Companies:</span> Amazon, Microsoft, Intel, Bosch, Deloitte, Infosys, TCS, Accenture, Nvidia, Boeing, Adobe, HCL</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Postgrad Fields:</span> Robotics, IoT, Embedded Systems, AI</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Top Institutions:</span> TUM, RWTH Aachen, ETH Zurich</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Mechatronics Engineering</h2>
    <p><span class="highlight">Highest Package:</span> ₹12 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Average Package:</span> ₹4.2 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Hiring Companies:</span> Bosch, Mahindra & Mahindra, TVS Motors, L&T, Siemens, ABB</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Postgrad Fields:</span> Robotics, Automation, Control Systems</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Top Institutions:</span> MIT, Stanford, ETH Zurich</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Industrial Engineering</h2>
    <p><span class="highlight">Highest Package:</span> ₹54.75 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Average Package:</span> ₹12.59 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Median Package:</span> ₹8.5 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Hiring Companies:</span> Amazon, Deloitte, Infosys, TCS, Accenture, Bosch, KPMG, PwC</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Postgrad Fields:</span> Data Analytics, Supply Chain Management, Operations Research</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Top Institutions:</span> TUM, RWTH Aachen, Georgia Tech</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Mechanical Engineering</h2>
    <p><span class="highlight">Highest Package:</span> ₹15–20 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Average Package:</span> ₹6 LPA</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Placement Rate:</span> 60% – 70%</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Hiring Companies:</span> L&T, Tata Motors, Mahindra & Mahindra, Bosch, TVS Motors, Ashok Leyland</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Postgrad Fields:</span> Automotive Engineering, Thermal Engineering, Design Engineering</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Top Institutions:</span> TUM, RWTH Aachen, University of Michigan</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section" style="background:#eef6fc;">
    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p><strong>Cyber-Physical Systems:</strong> Strong prospects in tech-driven industries with competitive placement packages.</p>
    <p><strong>Mechatronics Engineering:</strong> Moderate placement statistics; better suited for those aiming for specialized postgraduate studies.</p>
    <p><strong>Industrial Engineering:</strong> High placement packages with opportunities in analytics and operations; excellent for transitioning into data-centric roles.</p>
    <p><strong>Mechanical Engineering:</strong> Traditional core engineering roles with stable placement records; ideal for those interested in manufacturing and design.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
